# 🇰🇷 Korea Ish E'lonlari — Telegram Job Aggregator Bot

A production-ready Telegram userbot that automatically collects job announcements from multiple Uzbek community groups in South Korea and reposts them into a single public channel: **Korea Ish E'lonlari**.

